# Salesforce Console-Based Application — Employee Management System

## Assignment Chosen

### Employee Management System

Develop a menu-driven Employee Management System that manages:

* Employee ID
* Employee Name
* Email
* Birth Date
* Department

Using Salesforce Apex (Console Based).

---

# Goal of This Assignment

You will create:

1. A custom Employee object
2. Fields inside the object
3. An Apex class
4. CRUD operations:

   * Add Employee
   * View Employees
   * Update Employee
   * Delete Employee
5. Execute everything using Anonymous Apex Console

